      "translation": "“呵……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "note": "修兰听到雷本表态后轻笑，随后称其为奇美拉的幼狮。"
    },
    {
      "id": "sd/story/001/dialogue/01.01/0023",
      "source_text": "「ああ！」",
